            "type": "game",
            "name": "Marble Skies",
            "steam_appid": 742460,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.poster.avif?t=1764397550\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.webm?t=1764397550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.mp4?t=1764397550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><br>Marble Skies is a fast paced 3D-platformer where you control your marble through various levels and try to get the best time for each one. Complete all the levels in your own time, or challenge your friends to get on top of the leaderboards! Inspired by nostalgia, Marble Madness and Marble Blast.</i><br><br><strong>NOW HAS MULTIPLAYER BETA!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features -</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>60 Base levels! + 52 Bonus, Community levels &amp; <strong>9 GOLF LEVELS!</strong><br><br></li><li>Arcade style physics<br>Quick and responsive controls, using your keyboard and mouse, or even a controller mean that every input you make will be accurate! <br><br></li><li>Platforming obstacles and powerups<br>Each new level presents exciting obstacles, and powerups for your marble! Blast your way around with a Rocket, become a giant with the Super Marble, float like Mary Poppins with an Alien powerup and more!<br><br></li><li> Great soundtrack<br>With 56 amazing different tracks by Stevia Sphere, you will be humming along with them in no time! Preview or buy the soundtrack here! <br><br><br></li><li>Leaderboards<br>Get to the top of the leaderboards, and show off to your friends! Can you get the fastest time?<br><br></li><li>Controller support<br>Support for all different types of controllers!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.poster.avif?t=1764397550\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.webm?t=1764397550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742460/extras/41013ecb6444e35e427cd9728fdb6a9e.mp4?t=1764397550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><br>Marble Skies is a fast paced 3D-platformer where you control your marble through various levels and try to get the best time for each one. Complete all the levels in your own time, or challenge your friends to get on top of the leaderboards! Inspired by nostalgia, Marble Madness and Marble Blast.</i><br><br><strong>NOW HAS MULTIPLAYER BETA!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features -</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>60 Base levels! + 52 Bonus, Community levels &amp; <strong>9 GOLF LEVELS!</strong><br><br></li><li>Arcade style physics<br>Quick and responsive controls, using your keyboard and mouse, or even a controller mean that every input you make will be accurate! <br><br></li><li>Platforming obstacles and powerups<br>Each new level presents exciting obstacles, and powerups for your marble! Blast your way around with a Rocket, become a giant with the Super Marble, float like Mary Poppins with an Alien powerup and more!<br><br></li><li> Great soundtrack<br>With 56 amazing different tracks by Stevia Sphere, you will be humming along with them in no time! Preview or buy the soundtrack here! <br><br><br></li><li>Leaderboards<br>Get to the top of the leaderboards, and show off to your friends! Can you get the fastest time?<br><br></li><li>Controller support<br>Support for all different types of controllers!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Marble Skies is a fast paced 3D-platformer where you control your marble through various levels and try to get the best time for each one. Complete all the levels in your own time, or challenge your friends to get on top of the leaderboards!",
